sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Student browser
    participant S as app.py
    participant D as MySQL
    B->>S: POST assignment ID and link
    S->>D: Insert Document and read its ID
    S->>D: Find submission for student and assignment
    alt First submission
        S->>D: Insert Submission and read its ID
    else Resubmission
        S->>D: Update SubmittedAt on existing row
    end
    S->>D: Insert SubmissionDocument
    S->>D: Commit all writes
    S-->>B: Redirect to assignments
